meta {
  name: Wishlist
  seq: 11
}

docs {
  # Wishlist

  Books the reader hopes to obtain. A wishlist item is **not** a catalogue book: it never appears
  in `GET /books`, has no copies, sessions, notes or groups, and duplicates are allowed. When the
  reader gets the book, they add it to the catalogue with `POST /books` and then record the
  acquisition, which links the wish to that owned book; nothing is created automatically.

  Run the folder in order. **Register wishlist reader** creates its own disposable account and
  the folder creates its own books, so it is independent of every other folder.
  Contract: `docs/api-contract.md` ("Wishlist management").
}
